        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For each of the countries in which we operate, the automotive aftermarket industry includes all products and services purchased for light and heavy-duty vehicles after the original sale and is made up of four segments: labor share of professional service provider sales, auto parts share of professional service provider sales, DIY sales, and tire sales.",
