        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To augment our robust distribution network, we operate a total of 399 Hub stores that also provide delivery service and same-day access to stores within the surrounding areas to an average of 63,000 SKUs, with Hubs in select markets carrying further enhanced inventory levels up to approximately 115,000 SKUs.",
