        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we will continue to have a competitive advantage on the professional service provider portion of our business, due to our systems, knowledge, industry-leading parts availability, and experience serving the professional service provider side of the automotive aftermarket, augmented by our approximately 825 full-time sales staff dedicated solely to calling upon and servicing the professional service provider customer.",
